        "student_prefix_sha256": "5277e9cb6e272da6f59c697c6e5cea43cc457e6b0476414f3725248f9ad8c2ee",
        "target": "First, I identify the given quantities:\n- Total computers: 20\n- Unfixable computers: 20% of 20\n- Computers needing spare parts: 40% of 20\n\nNext, I calculate the number of unfixable computers:\n20% of 20 = 0.20 * 20 = 4 computers\n\nThen, I calculate the number of computers needing spare parts:\n40% of 20 = 0.40 * 20 = 8 computers\n\nNow, I find the number of computers John was able to fix right away by subtracting the unfixable and those needing spare parts from the total:\n20 - 4 - 8 = 8 computers\n\nSo, John was able to fix 8 computers right away.\n\nFINAL: 8",
